
# 2025-11-20 21:52:51.708097
+Code the following app
+```
+Description:
+Liquidity Mining Reward Tracker helps users monitor their rewards from liquidity mining programs in real-time. Track earned tokens, APYs, and upcoming reward distributions across multiple DeFi platforms.
+
+Key Features:
+ • Real-time tracking of liquidity mining rewards.
+ • Historical charts showing earned rewards and APY trends.
+ • Support for multiple DeFi protocols and chains.
+ • Alerts for reward distribution events or changes in APY.
+ • Portfolio overview for all liquidity mining positions.
+
+Target Users:
+DeFi users, liquidity providers, and yield farmers who want to optimize rewards and track earnings efficiently.
+
+Usage Instructions:
+ 1. Connect your wallet or input liquidity positions manually.
+ 2. View real-time earned rewards and APY metrics.
+ 3. Set alerts for reward events or changes in yield.
+ 4. Analyze historical performance to plan future liquidity allocations.
+
+Benefits:
+ • Maximize earnings by staying informed in real-time.
+ • Efficiently track multiple positions across protocols.
+ • Make data-driven decisions to optimize liquidity mining rewards.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

